      "name": "SetGlobalContextValue",
      "signature": "uint SetGlobalContextValue(uint dwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Sets a global context value in a thread-safe manner using critical section locking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Enter critical section lock on global buffer at offset 0x130\n2. Store the provided value at global buffer offset 0x328\n3. Leave critical section lock\n4. Return success indicator (1)\n\nParameters:\ndwValue (uint): Value to store in the global context buffer\n\nReturns:\nuint: Always returns 1 to indicate successful operation\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x130: Offset to critical section in global buffer (304 bytes)\n- 0x328: Offset to context value storage location (808 bytes)\n- 1: Success return value\n\nError Handling:\n- Function always succeeds as it performs simple memory assignment\n- Critical section ensures thread-safe access to shared global buffer",
