      "signature": "int SetAsyncFileHandle(dword dwFileHandle, int * pAsyncOp)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Associates a file handle with an async file operation structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Pushes both parameters onto stack (converts __fastcall to __stdcall)\n2. Tail-calls Ordinal_267 to perform actual handle association\n\nParameters:\n- dwFileHandle (dword): File handle to associate\n- pAsyncOp (int*): Async file operation structure pointer\n\nReturns:\n- Non-zero on success, 0 on failure (caller asserts on 0)",
